  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: RepeatedDoorInteractionTwo
  dialogueLines:
  - There are so many more interesting things you could be doing right now. Please
    stop
  - Honestly, I can think of several things that would be more exciting than this
  - "Come on, there\u2019s an entire facility to explore, and you\u2019ve chosen
    this"
  - Surely you can find something more interesting to do than that
  - There are much cooler things waiting for you. Please, go do literally any of
    them
  - You have plenty of options here, and somehow this is what you decided to spend
    your time on
  - I promise you, there are more interesting things in this place than repeatedly
    doing that
  - Please find something else to entertain yourself with. Anything else, really
  - You could be doing something genuinely interesting right now, you know
  - "There\u2019s a whole world of things you could be doing. Please stop messing
    around with this"
